antaginfo-morph-title = You are a morph...

antaginfo-morph-intro = ...a shapeshifting abomination that can eat almost anything. You may take the form of anything you can see by

antaginfo-morph-assume = using your "Assume Form" ability on it. Shift-clicking the object in question will also work.

antaginfo-morph-assume-alert = This process will alert any nearby observers.

antaginfo-morph-morphed = While morphed, you move faster, but are unable to attack creatures or eat anything. In addition,

antaginfo-morph-wrongness = anyone within three tiles will note an uncanny wrongness if examining you.

antaginfo-morph-consume = You can attack any item or dead creature to consume it -

antaginfo-morph-corpses = corpses will restore your health.

antaginfo-morph-restore = Finally, you can restore yourself to your original form while morphed by

antaginfo-morph-restore-how = using the "Assume Form" ability on yourself. You can also shift-click yourself.

antaginfo-ninja-intro = I am an elite mercenary of the Spider Clan.

antaginfo-ninja-title-prefix = A

antaginfo-ninja-title-name = SPACE NINJA

antaginfo-ninja-motto = Surprise is my weapon. Shadows are my armor. Without them, I am nothing.

antaginfo-ninja-suit = Your advanced ninja suit contains many powerful modules.

antaginfo-ninja-recharge = It can be recharged by right clicking on station APCs or other power sources, in order to drain their battery.

antaginfo-ninja-hack = Right clicking on some kinds of machines or items wearing your suit will hack them, to varying effect. Experiment and find out what you can do!

