antaginfo-revolution-joke-1 = Annoy the heads of staff as much as possible without harming them.

antaginfo-revolution-joke-2 = Disguise as the heads of staff and confuse the crew.

antaginfo-revolution-joke-3 = Make revolutionary artwork and vandalize the station with it.

antaginfo-revolution-joke-4 = Mass produce picket signs and wave them around the station.

antaginfo-revolution-joke-5 = Start a cult worshipping the proletariat.

antaginfo-revolution-example-1 = Sabotage the station's power grid.

antaginfo-revolution-example-2 = Steal the Head of Personnel's pet dog.

antaginfo-revolution-example-3 = Turn the Head of Security's team against them.

antaginfo-revolution-example-4 = Waste the station's funds and resources.

antaginfo-revolution-example-5 = Blow up the Research Director with a bomb.

antaginfo-revolution-example-6 = Bribe the Quartermaster to self-exile.

antaginfo-revolution-example-7 = Capture anyone with a mindshield and have it surgically removed.

antaginfo-revolution-example-8 = Create an army of mechs to march on the bridge.

antaginfo-revolution-example-9 = Cut off the air supply to the brig.

antaginfo-revolution-example-10 = Equip your leaders with the best gear you can find.

antaginfo-revolution-example-11 = Find the remaining heads of staff and eliminate them.

antaginfo-revolution-example-12 = Follow your leaders as closely as possible.

antaginfo-revolution-example-13 = Gather weapons and armor.

antaginfo-revolution-example-14 = Go out in a blaze of glory.

antaginfo-revolution-example-15 = Lie low until we have enough numbers to strike.

antaginfo-revolution-example-16 = Occupy the bridge and hold it until the heads of staff surrender.

antaginfo-revolution-example-17 = Protect your leaders at all costs, even if it means sacrifice.

antaginfo-revolution-example-18 = Protest in front of the bridge.

antaginfo-revolution-example-19 = Rescue other revolutionaries from the brig.

antaginfo-revolution-example-20 = Rush the Captain and take his hat.

antaginfo-revolution-example-21 = Subvert the AI to betray the heads of staff.

antaginfo-revolution-example-22 = Take the Chief Medical Officer hostage.

antaginfo-revolution-example-23 = Throw the Chief Engineer into the Supermatter.

antaginfo-revolution-example-24 = Trick the heads of staff into exiling themselves.

antaginfo-revolution-example-25 = Wait for the emergency shuttle, then strike in the chaos.

